{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Lo, how a [Bb]rose [F]e'er [C]bloom[Dm]ing [Bb]From [F]ten[C]der [Dm]stem [C]hath [F]sprung,
[F]Of Jesse's [Bb]lin[F]eage [C]com[Dm]ing [Bb]As [F]men [C]of [Dm]old [C]have [F]sung.
[F]It [Gm]came, [Am]a[F]flower[G]et [C]bright,
[C]Amid [F]the [Bb]cold [F]of [C]win[D]ter [Gm]When [F]half [Gm]spent [F]was [C]the [F]night.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F][Bb][F]Isaiah [C][Dm][Bb]'twas [F][C][Dm]foretold [C][F]it,
[F][Bb]The [F][C]Rose [Dm][Bb]I [F][C]have [Dm][C]in [F]mind,
[F][Gm]With [Am]Mary [F]we [G]beheld [C]it,
[C][F][Bb]The [F][C][D]virgin [Gm][F][Gm]mother [F][C][F]kind.
[F][Bb][F]To [C][Dm]show [Bb][F]God's [C][Dm]love [C][F]aright
[F][Bb]She [F][C]bore [Dm][Bb]to [F][C]them [Dm][C]a [F]Savior,
[F]When [Gm]half [Am]spent [F]was [G]the [C]night.
{end_of_verse}
